{"3529400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mow Meow", "steam_appid": 3529400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mow catnip. Unlock furr. Hang out.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/87d533d77e59fcad30a992a9c957926c.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"mowing and showing floating catnip amounts\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/87d533d77e59fcad30a992a9c957926c.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/87d533d77e59fcad30a992a9c957926c.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Mow Meow, where you're a stretchy, slightly broken cat. You have one job: mow catnip. That's it, that's the game... well, sort of. The more 'nip you gather, the more furr, shoes, and hats you unlock to deck out your feline. Solo's fine. So is teaming up with friends or randos - it's a weird lil' multiplayer world and the catnip isn't going to mow itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4f6f36fcd6ddc7a7fb3be9824ccfda43.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"one cat mowing into several other cats while one cat is floating \" width=320 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4f6f36fcd6ddc7a7fb3be9824ccfda43.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4f6f36fcd6ddc7a7fb3be9824ccfda43.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you'll experience strange quests, random emails and NPCs that want to sell you a meditation album for some reason. Customize your cat and get weird with it. The 'nip keeps growing. So do the surprises. 🙀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/c184b93b70fb64a8b858388af1be27e1.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"cat walking in a loop showing different furr and shoes while wearing the same hat\" width=300 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/c184b93b70fb64a8b858388af1be27e1.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/c184b93b70fb64a8b858388af1be27e1.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer mowing with up to 20 friends or total strangers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up unlocks furr, boosts your luck and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable hats, boots &amp; furr, featuring mysterious broken upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange, buggy low-gravity kitty controls (it's a feature!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33-song original soundtrack doing some serious emotional heavy lifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird emails and quests scattered around for the curious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing? Yes. Addictive? Also yes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Steam achievements now and more on the way (using cats from, like, the real world!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using keyboard only if you want, so throw away that mouse (no wait, don't do that)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support except for popping open chat (will get that working on the Steam deck soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly NPCs with voice acting from friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat and music player with aesthetics stolen from the 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code system for wacky modifications and catnip cheats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets (can't say anything more about this because, well, it's a secret)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can even be played in a 640x480 window so you can play a real game while playing this one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More boroughs, NPCs, collars, mowers, and power-ups in the works </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More GIFs? Sure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use a code to activate some chaos...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ce2293b90d33429bc25bb1eca29b88ea.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"code system showing stretchy cat, big cat and flying cat\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ce2293b90d33429bc25bb1eca29b88ea.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ce2293b90d33429bc25bb1eca29b88ea.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nip Nip Player? Yup yup!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ec8540706f42900114106883021a0302.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"music player with a visualizer\" width=320 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ec8540706f42900114106883021a0302.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/ec8540706f42900114106883021a0302.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find or buy albums using dat 'nip...</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/d82d2da6627e9f2b60c05a77ca9294bf.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"selecting multiple albums on off showing the CDs, with one spinning\" width=262 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/d82d2da6627e9f2b60c05a77ca9294bf.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/d82d2da6627e9f2b60c05a77ca9294bf.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Click on an unlocked achievement to bring up a kitty!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/13ef175d618751c7cebb362bdaf52cfb.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"achievement system where you can click on your unlocked achievements to show real life cats on screen, aww cute\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/13ef175d618751c7cebb362bdaf52cfb.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/13ef175d618751c7cebb362bdaf52cfb.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You got meow! Dang right you do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1c061c486f64e4ad7fc3b914491cff55.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"email system\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1c061c486f64e4ad7fc3b914491cff55.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1c061c486f64e4ad7fc3b914491cff55.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bouncing on 'dem springs...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/9ebb5803c6ab3b9e09623860139c50f5.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"cat jumping on a spring\" width=320 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/9ebb5803c6ab3b9e09623860139c50f5.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/9ebb5803c6ab3b9e09623860139c50f5.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here's Dr. Katz.</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1f879466b5f4e619167c5e2d09c71100.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"a cat talking to another cat named Dr. Katz\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1f879466b5f4e619167c5e2d09c71100.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/1f879466b5f4e619167c5e2d09c71100.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All praise VOG!</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4774b8cbf1b0f4668f6fedb4ea96c96c.poster.avif?t=1783542520\" aria-label=\"VOG is a jelly like cat god\" width=320 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4774b8cbf1b0f4668f6fedb4ea96c96c.webm?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529400/extras/4774b8cbf1b0f4668f6fedb4ea96c96c.mp4?t=1783542520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mow together. Gather together. </i>Stay weird together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to check out  for updates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy mowing! 😸</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mow catnip. Unlock furr. Hang out.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai